    "final_response_text": "The products most urgently at risk of stock-outs are those with the largest negative stock gap, indicating they are below their reorder level. Here are the top products at risk:\n\n1. **Gorgonzola Telino**: 0 units in stock, reorder level 20, stock gap -20\n2. **Louisiana Hot Spiced Okra**: 4 units in stock, reorder level 20, stock gap -16\n3. **Mascarpone Fabioli**: 9 units in stock, reorder level 25, stock gap -16\n4. **Outback Lager**: 15 units in stock, reorder level 30, stock gap -15\n5. **Gravad lax**: 11 units in stock, reorder level 25, stock gap -14\n\nThese products should be prioritized for restocking to avoid potential stock-outs.",
