    "question": "How does average order value differ across customer countries?",
    "status": "success",
    "http_status": 200,
    "latency_ms_total": 3256,
    "error": null,
    "final_response_text": "The average order value varies significantly across customer countries. Here are some highlights:\n\n- **Austria** has the highest average order value at approximately 1,024.\n- **Ireland** follows with an average order value of about 909.\n- **Denmark** and **Germany** have average order values of around 710 and 702, respectively.\n- **USA** and **Canada** also have relatively high average order values, at approximately 698 and 669.\n\nThese values indicate differences in purchasing behavior or pricing strategies across countries.",
